                <pb facs="0258" n="174" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg174"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupré to Mr.
                            Hay, via consulate at Colon.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation to Colombia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1903-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                                1903</hi>.</date><lb/>(From Colon, August 18,
                    1903.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>No cable received since (the) 13th July, the company having closed Buenaventura
                    office. Government does not allow cables to pass over land lines. Situation
                    critical. American minister Bogota. August 5.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Malmros.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
